	(footprint "controller-board:PinSocket_2x10_P2.00mm_Vertical_UnderBoard"
		(layer "B.Cu")
		(uuid "e87c78a1-1c3f-4bd4-b988-145df12cba2a")
		(at 102.07 115.22 180)
		(descr "2x10 2.00mm socket mounted on the BOTTOM face, mating a male header that points up from below (Waveshare P1 through the three-socket totem). Numbering is pre-mirrored: defined front-side with columns walking -X, so that flipped to B.Cu the pads land exactly on P1's grid viewed from above - pin 1 at origin, pin 2 at +Y (outside row), odd pins walking +X. Pads match KiCad's PinSocket_2x10_P2.00mm_Vertical: 1.35 pad, 0.8 drill. For Sullins NPPN102AFCN-RC tails (0.50 sq).")
